			"notes": "Turns out there was a game-breaking bug lurking in the mod for a while that was never reported. I think it's both the dumbest and most severe bug in the mod to date, so... that's embarrassing.\n* Fixed centrifuges causing the chunks they're in to not save. Because I forgot to register the block entities. Like an idiot.\n\nAdditionally:\n* Fixed centrifuge outputs being reversed when the centrifuge points east or west.\n* Made Philosopher's Stone formulas spawn in fewer types of chest, so hopefully they're not as annoyingly common."
		},
