			"notes": "Art of Alchemy is finally nearing a state I'm happy with, so I feel comfortable putting out a release candidate! Here's what's changed:\n- #20: Comparators can now detect the alkahest level of Dissolution Chambers and Projection Altars, and the essentia level of Essentia Tanks and Synthesis Tables.\n- #28: Fixed the Synthesis Table listing requirements even with no target item.\n- #29: Fixed conduits moved by pistons not updating the essentia networks, resulting in strange behavior.\n- #30: Fixed essentia tanks not rendering on the new Fabulous graphics settings.\n- #31: Fixed \"unknown recipe category\" console spam on world load.\n- Migrated from containers to screen handlers."
		},
