			"notes": "I'd like to apologize for the long delay in updating this mod to the latest version. I've had some mental health problems as of late, and while that's still a pressing concern for me, I wanted to at least get AoA up to the pre-releases so it can be ready for the 1.16 release. Thank you for your patience!\n\nNot many changes this release, since I wanted to get the port out as soon as possible:\n- Adds Korean localization, thanks to @mindy15963 \n- Removes filtered essentia vessels (which were already deprecated)\n- Updates to the 1.16 pre-releases; there were quite a few technical changes, so let me know if anything broke\n\nHotfix 1 (0.7.0.1):\n- Fixes #27."
		},
