			"notes": "**0.5.0 Magnum Opus**\n\n * The basic version of the Synthesis Table can now only synthesize up to Rank C.\n * The basic version of the Calcination Furnace has been slowed down somewhat.\n * Adds the legendary Philosopher's Stone. But how do you get it?\n * Adds upgraded versions of the Calcination Furnace, Dissolution Chamber, and Synthesis Table.\n    * All three are twice as fast, and are crafted with the Philosopher's Stone.\n    * The Calcinator has double the fuel efficiency.\n    * The Calcinator and Dissolver have full recovery rate rather than half.\n    * The Dissolver and Synthesizer have twice the tank space.\n    * The Synthesizer can synthesize with all ranks of materia.\n * Adds the Projection Altar, which also requires a Philosopher's Stone to craft. It upgrades materia to higher ranks using alkahest."
